description:
This anthology is packed with seven wonderful stories about naughty episodes between young boys and their "older sisters" from the super healthy boys' comic magazine Monthly Shonen Champion!! All sorts of things with our slightly naughty "older sisters"...we just love our "older sisters"!!! Included works: Mantsuman by Minamoto Yuu; Bathhouse Reception Paradise by Sogabe Toshinori; Cigarettes with Older Sister by Akegata Iruka; My Older Sister Will Teach You by Chiaki Taro; I'm Your Body Pillow by Hori Hiroaki; Kasumi-neechan Don't Be Dependent!! by Haseyoshi Eria; Stray Boy by Itosugi Masahiro;

---
Cover: [Miyamoto Issa](https://mangadex.org/author/d12ab053-6dd1-46dc-9307-e506cbf3a78b)

## A series of yuri one-shots
1. **Melody**
About two childhood friends who like music and who are asked to perform at the graduation ceremony of their school;

2. **Longing**
Deals with two members of the archery club: Kyoko and her senpai Touko, who is ashamed of her man-like body;

3. **Spice**
About a young girls-loving teacher who wants to seduce her female students;

4. **Innocent**
About a nude portrait hanging in an art room, the model and the painter;

5. **Rendez-vous**
About two girls secretly in love who plan to elope together after being found out.
